<title>GERMANY: Dresdner sees double-digit profit growth.</title>
<headline>Dresdner sees double-digit profit growth.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Dresdner Bank AG expected double-digit growth in operating profit this year, chief executive Juergen Sarrazin said on Tuesday at a news conference.</p>
<p>Sarrazin did not give a precise target for operating profit for 1997.</p>
<p>In the first half of the year, operating profit rose 23 percent to 1.7 billion marks.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
</text>
